# 📊 Power BI Financial Analytics Dashboard (2013–2014)

This project is a complete **Financial Analytics Dashboard** built in **Power BI**, using the official **Microsoft Sample Excel Workbook** (≈700 rows).  
The dataset covers the last four months of **2013** and the full year of **2014**, across **five products** and multiple customer segments.

The dashboard provides insights into **profit trends**, **customer segmentation**, **product performance**, and **market-level profitability**.

---

## 🚀 Project Highlights

### ✔ Two-Page Power BI Dashboard  
- **Overview Page**  
- **Customer Segments & Products Page**

### ✔ KPIs Included  
- Average Revenue  
- Average Sales Cost  
- Annual Profit  
- Profit Percentage  

### ✔ Analyses Performed  
- Profit Trend Analysis  
- Country-wise Profit Distribution  
- Product-Level Analysis  
- Customer Segment Performance  
- **RFM Segmentation** (Champion, Loyal, Potential, Churned)  
- Demand trend visualization using sparklines  

