# 🖥️ Dashboard Pages & Visuals

---

## 1️⃣ Overview Dashboard

This page provides a high-level view of the business performance.

### Visuals Used
- **Line Chart:** Monthly Profit Trend  
- **Map Visual:** Countries generating highest profit  
- **Clustered Bar Chart:** Product sales across customer segments  
- **KPI Cards:**  
  - Avg Revenue ($59M)  
  - Avg Sales Cost  
  - Annual Profit  
  - Profit Percentage  
- **Date Filter Button** for interactive filtering  

### Key Insights
- 📅 **Highest Profit Month/Year:**  
  **December 2014 — $2,025,765.90**

- 🌍 **Top Profit Countries:**  
  Germany, France, US, Canada, Mexico  
  *(Bubble sizes are almost the same)*

- 🎯 **Investment Recommendation:**  
  - Government segment leads across all products  
  - Focus on improving **Small Business** sales to further boost profit  

---

## 2️⃣ Customer Segments & Products Page

This page offers a deeper breakdown of product and segment behavior.

### Visuals Used

#### **A. Product Matrix**
Includes:  
- Avg Units Sold  
- Total Sales  
- Sales Cost  
- Profit  
- Demand Trend (Sparkline)

#### **B. Customer Segments Matrix (RFM Analysis)**
Segments classified into:  
- Champion  
- Loyal High Value  
- Potential  
- Churned / Low Value  

**Results:**  
- 🟢 **Champion Segment:** Government — Profit ~ **$11.4M**  
- 🟡 **Loyal High Value:** Small Business — Profit ~ **$4.1M**  
- 🔴 **Churned / Low Value:** Enterprise — Loss ~ **$0.6M**  

#### **C. Stacked Bar Chart**
- Profit distribution across customer segments  

